# Tech Stack (고정)

Full SSOT: `docs/TECH_STACK.md`

## Workflow

Lovable 생성 → GitHub export → Cursor pull → 최적화/감사 → `bun run check` GREEN

## State Management

- **Server State**: TanStack Query + Supabase Realtime (profile, wallet, missions, events, trading)
- **UI / Game State**: `walletStore` (useSyncExternalStore), `createGameStore`, `plinkoStore` 등 기존 구조 유지
- **Zustand 도입 금지** — Phase 3 트레이딩 엔진 단계에서 재검토

## Frontend

- TanStack Start **v1** + TanStack Router (`src/routes/` only)
- **React 19** + **TypeScript strict**
- **Tailwind v4** CSS-first — `src/styles.css` `@theme` SSOT, no raw hex
- **Framer Motion** — `LazyMotion` + `domAnimation` only (no full `motion` import tree)
- `vite.config.ts` — @lovable.dev/vite-tanstack-config only; **no manual plugins** (PWA = Cursor)

## Validation

- **Zod** — Money Layer, Onboarding, Withdrawal, missions/events/trading RPC 응답 검증의 SSOT
- 스키마 위치: `lib/{domain}/schemas.ts` → `lib/api/*.ts`에서 parse

## Monorepo (target)

pnpm: `apps/web` + `apps/admin` + `packages/*`  
Current root is transitional (bun) until split.

## Supabase (phonara-gb ONLY)

- RLS on all public tables
- Money: RPC `SECURITY DEFINER` + `search_path` + `auth.uid()`
- Realtime + Edge Functions: Cursor only
- NEVER: phonara-world-main, phonetok

## Charts & Performance

- Exchange: `lightweight-charts` (npm package)
- Games: Canvas2D (visual) separated from wallet/settlement
- Heavy compute: **Web Workers** — RNG, 물리 연산 등 메인 스레드 분리; 60fps 목표
- Worker SSOT: `src/shared/workers/`

## Testing

- **vitest** + jsdom + `@testing-library/react` — 기본 테스트 스택 (유지)
- Money 핵심 경로(bet, payout, withdrawal, mission claim)는 테스트 필수
- 순수 계산 로직(Engine, `lib/*/progress.ts` 등)은 vitest 우선; bun test 별도 허용

## Future Preparation

- `@types/bun` — devDependency로 설치 (Bun 확장 대비)
- `lib/bun-trading/`, Elysia / Hono / Drizzle — **Phase 3**에서 검토 (현재 미도입)

## Lovable must NOT

- Edit supabase/, types.ts, lib/api/, walletStore schema, PWA config, vite plugins
